her than it has been since the flood of 280, and the old dyke above Sefeathf is weeping. The Reeve of Sefeathf needs hands to shore it, and someone to find out who has been cutting the dyke at night.","title":"Rising Water"},{"id":"h10.wolf_winter","kind":"wolf_winter","refs":[{"id":"10","kind":"settlement"},{"id":"r10.reeve","kind":"role"}],"tension":40,"text":"A shepherd from Sefeathf came down from the forest edge raving about eyes in the dark and refuses to go back. The flock is still up there.","title":"The Last Shepherd"}],"id":"10","name":"Sefeathf","prosperity":{"present":114,"samples":[[97,49],[100,49],[125,34],[150,66],[175,74],[200,83],[225,91],[250,3],[275,1],[293,114]],"trend":"recovering"},"realm_id":"2","roles":[{"building":"7","class":null,"duties":"Answers to the lord for the village's dues and labour days.","faction":null,"family_name":null,"female":null,"given_name":null,"id":"r10.reeve","kind":"reeve","settlement":"10","stat_block":"commoner","title":"Reeve of Sefeathf"},{"building":"3","class":null,"duties":"Tends the shrine and keeps the feast days.","faction":"f10.shrine","family_name":null,"female":null,"given_name":null,"id":"r10.shrine_keeper","kind":"shrine_keeper","settlement":"10","stat_block":"acolyte","title":"Keeper of the Sefeathf Shrine"},{"building":"1","class":null,"duties":"Assigns berths, collects harbour dues and watches the tides.","faction":null,"family_name":null,"female":null,"given_name":null,"id":"r10.harbourmaster","kind":"harbourmaster","settlement":"10","stat_block":"scout","title":"Harbourmaster of Sefeathf"},{"building":"2","class":null,"duties":"Speaks for the boats and shares out the fishing grounds.","faction":"f10.fishers","family_name":null,"female":null,"given_name":null,"id":"r10.fisher_head","kind":"fisher_head","settlement":"10","stat_block":"commoner","title":"Headman of the Sefeathf Fishers"},{"building":"8","class":null,"duties":"Speaks for the common folk at moots and to the lord.","faction":"f10.commons